                                    <h2>It all starts with you</h2>
                                <p>Cybersecurity is a shared responsibility, and we all have a role to play. While the University has strong systems in place, staying cyber safe also means making smart choices: using strong passwords, enabling multifactor authentication, updating your devices and speaking up when something doesn&rsquo;t seem right.</p><p>Explore our latest news, scam alerts and practical tips to help you stay informed and protected. If you spot a phishing email, need to report an incident, or just want some advice, the Cybersecurity team is here to help.</p><p><a href="https://www.unimelb.edu.au/cybersecurity/about" class="button">About us</a></p>
